FIRST — UNDERSTAND THE PROJECT

Before criticizing anything, understand:

* What TrustNetAI is trying to solve
* Who the user is
* Who the customer is
* What problem they have
* Why the problem matters
* How the system supposedly solves it
* What makes AI necessary
* What makes graph intelligence necessary
* What makes smart-city infrastructure relevant
* What makes FinTech relevant
* What the actual output of the system is
* What decision the user is supposed to make after using it
